    ```html
    <p class="card-text">
        {% for project in charity.projects.split(',') %}
            \u2022 {{ project }}<br>
        {% endfor %}
    </p>
    ```  

#### **Data Storage:**  
- **File Adjustments:**  
  - Ensure all files are in the root directory (no missing files).  
  - Add `lockfile.txt` to simulate write locks (prevent corruption):  
    ```python
    def write_donation():
        while os.path.exists('lockfile.txt'):
